>Mellersh</surname><given-names>DG</given-names></name><name><surname>Foulds</surname><given-names>IV</given-names></name><name><surname>Higgins</surname><given-names>VJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Heath</surname><given-names>MC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>H2O2 plays different roles in determining penetration failure in three diverse plant-fungal interactions</article-title><source>Plant J</source><year>2002</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>257</fpage><lpage>268</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11844104</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1046/j.0960-7412.2001.01215.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Scholten</surname><given-names>OE</given-names></name><name><surname>Panella</surname><given-names>LW</given-names></name><name><surname>De Bock</surname><given-names>TSM</given-names></name><name><surname>Lange</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A greenhouse test for screening sugar beet (<italic>Beta vulgaris</italic>) for resistance to <italic>Rhizoctonia solani</italic></article-title><source>Eur J Plant Pathol</source><year>2001</year><volume>107</volume><fpage>161</fpage><lpage>166</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1023/A:1011208903344</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lucena</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Romero-Aranda</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Mercado</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Cuartero</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Valpuesta</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Quesada</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Structural and physiological changes in the roots of tomato plants over-expressing a basic peroxidase</article-title><so